Red Hood had no strength left. She tumbled into bed unconscious. Mother and granny decided to split to have better chances for success. Old lady headed to Mother's house as it was closer to her and Mother rushed through the forest to the edge hoping to meet daughter.
-Hallo! - she called and listened, but it was useless.
Rushing past granny's hut, women peeked in the window, just in case. A sigh of relief burst out of her chest. There was her daughter Red Hood, peacefully sleeping in bed.
